#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/language/random/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Same tl.rng_* emission as the common implementation, but rng_init's default "
"sequence id derives from the thread context — and on Ascend the thread "
"domain lives in the enclosing T.SimtVF scope, so the derivation must go "
"through this dialect's thread accessors rather than the launch-frame ones "
"the CUDA module consults."
msgstr ""

